---
// Safety net: middleware.ts already redirects "/" → "/km/" in one hop,
// but keep this server-side 301 here so direct builds without middleware
// (e.g. static preview) still land on the right page. Never use meta-refresh
// because that triggers a client-side second redirect which can fight the
// trailing-slash and www/non-www rules and create redirect loops.
return Astro.redirect('/km/', 301);
---
